 "title": "Audio Flamingo Next (AF-Next)",
 "summary": "A state-of-the-art open large audio-language model series by NVIDIA and UMD for comprehensive understanding of sound, music, and speech. It enables fine-grained reasoning and multi-turn dialogue over complex audio environments using few-shot learning.",
